摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Zero-touch runtime telemetry for DeepSeek Harness: every session writes its own report card (task/model/tools/failures/duration) into a human-readable journal. 纯观察者运行事实遥测。","id":"gh:1334498224","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-observation-journal","slug":"Cavan-Ou/dsh-observation-journal","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","observability","observation","skill","telemetry"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Zero-touch runtime telemetry for DeepSeek Harness: every session writes its own report card (task/mo"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"del/tools/failures/duration) into a human-readable journal. 纯观察者运行事实遥测。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-observation-journal"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Zero-touch runtime telemetry for DeepSeek Harness: every session writes its own report card.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> 简体中文版见 README.zh.md"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A pure observer plugin (zero tools registered, zero LLM calls, zero agent involvement). When a sessi"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"on ends, it writes the run's facts — task, model tier, tools, failures, duration, status — into a hu"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"man-readable journal with an auto-updated stats section."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why it exists"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Failures have a recorder (dsh-fail-logger). Successes and run facts didn't. This is the sibling: **w"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"hat happened** — not how to solve it, not what to remember. No tools, no injection, no retrieval. Th"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"e harness writes passively; humans and projects read."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**What it is not** (boundaries, stated plainly):\n| Plugin | Records | Injects back into agent? | Con"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"is not** (boundaries, stated plainly):\n| Plugin | Records | Injects back into agent? | Consumption |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| **this** | run facts (telemetry) | never | human/project file |\n| dsh-task-planner | solutions (\"h"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ow to solve\") | yes (recall) | agent planning |\n| dsh-mneme / dsh-memento / dsh-memory | agent memor"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ies | yes (retrieval) | agent context |\n| dsh-fail-logger | failures | via skill | agent skill loadi"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"| yes (retrieval) | agent context |\n| dsh-fail-logger | failures | via skill | agent skill loading |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 60-second verification"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## What the output looks like"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The journal is the UI. A marker section that survives manual edits, plus an auto-stats block:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**raw sidecar** (`obsFile + '.jsonl'`, append-only): full fidelity — todo planning trace (≤5), compl"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ete tool counts, failed tools, full model id, full task description, normalized `task_hash`. This is"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" the v2 material for LLM insight; it is TTL-decoupled from the card."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Config (all optional, patch `config:` field)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| key | default | description |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| `obsFile` | `$DSH_HOME/observations.md` | journal path (point it at a project-level file) |\n| `max"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"Rows` | `200` | card keeps last N rows (raw sidecar unaffected) |\n| `marker` | `OBS-JOURNAL` | secti"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"on marker id, `[A-Za-z0-9-]` |\n| `redact` | `[]` | extra redaction regexes (stacked on the built-in "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"secret table) |\n| `flushMs` | `300` | trailing debounce after turn/end |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Env: `OBS_FILE` overrides `obsFile`; `OBS_REPLAY=<session.jsonl>` replays real events (test/CI mode)"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"nv: `OBS_FILE` overrides `obsFile`; `OBS_REPLAY=<session.jsonl>` replays real events (test/CI mode)."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Reliability"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- 10-column card rows: one row per session — no lossy merging\n- Task title escapes `|` and newlines;"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" secrets redacted (same table as fail-logger)\n- Cross-process write lock + stale lock reclaim; dispo"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"se fallback flushes sessions with no turn/end\n- **Tested against real session logs**: 14/14 replay t"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ests on 5 real .zstd fixtures (incl. a 2000+ event Pro long-synthesis session), field-by-field cross"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"-checked against independent recomputation; 21-session full replay verified human sections byte-iden"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"ked against independent recomputation; 21-session full replay verified human sections byte-identical"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
